  tipId: Hazard
  slides:
  - title: HAZARDS
    bodyText: "While hiking, you may encounter <color=#B22222><b>Hazards</b></color>
      that can cause harm. \r\n\r\nDon't worry too much\u2014all hazards are preceded
      by <color=#E65100><b>warning signs</b></color>. Keep a close watch on your
      surroundings and stay alert for any <b>weird or unusual</b> environmental changes!</color>"
    illustration: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fbd492863cfeaa8429436f45e0866b92, type: 3}
